# Input
```css
/* should generate diagnostics */
.prefixed-then-nested {
  border-radius: 1px;
  border: {
    radius: 2px;
  }
}

.nested-then-prefixed {
  font: {
    family: serif;
  }
  font-family: sans-serif;
}

.deeply-nested {
  border: {
    top: {
      left-radius: 1px;
    }
  }
  border-top-left-radius: 2px;
}

.group-with-value {
  font: 12px;
  font: bold {
    family: serif;
  }
}

.repeated-groups {
  margin: {
    top: 1px;
  }
  margin: {
    top: 2px;
  }
}

```

